OL,3,GNEWSAEducation pioneer gets blue plaque
OL,4,Aon former home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman believed to be the first female
OL,7,Fprofessor appointed by a British
OL,8,Funiversity has been celebrated with a
OL,9,Fblue plaque installed on her former
OL,10,Fhome.
OL,12,FEdith Morley played a central role in
OL,13,Fthe development of University College
OL,14,FReading, which became the town's
OL,15,Funiversity, and became a professor in
OL,16,FEnglish language there in 1908.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
