OL,3,GNEWSAEducation pioneer gets blue plaque
OL,4,Aon former home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prominent advocate for the fair
OL,7,Ftreatment of women in public and
OL,8,Fprofessional life, the plaque was
OL,9,Funveiled by Historic England on her
OL,10,Fformer home in Kendrick Road in
OL,11,FReading.
OL,13,FJacqui Turner, an associate professor
OL,14,Fof history at the University of
OL,15,FReading, nominated Morley for the blue
OL,16,Fplaque, who she said was a "remarkable
OL,17,Fpioneer".
